Aurora Extensions
Copyright 2026 AuroraReader contributors

This repository hosts a Mihon-compatible extension catalogue for AuroraReader
(Phase 4 Stub + Phase 5 MangaDex). The catalogue layout, APK naming conventions,
and `index.min.json` / `repo.json` shapes follow patterns established by the
Tachiyomi / Mihon extension ecosystem.

